invoke the handler once, synchronously or on the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"next main-queue turn, with the CURRENT state at install time. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adapter outlives the SDK session (one player, many sessions), so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"transition that lands between sessions — the previous session’s window","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"closing late, the next one not yet initialized — is otherwise consumed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by the adapter’s own change-dedup with nobody listening, and the new","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session starts believing the window is closed while the player is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"presenting in it (measured on the iOS e2e fleet, catalog-pip","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PIP-ENTER-DURING-* @ 0.50.0-beta.506). The renderer’s dedup makes the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"install-time delivery idempotent, so adapters need not special-case","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“nothing changed”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Install the single observer for presentation-mode changes. The handler","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"receives ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" when the window opens and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" when it closes,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whoever drove the transition. Installing replaces any previous handler.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore/documentation/OptiViewAdsCore/PlayerAdapter":{"title":"PlayerAdapter","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlayerAdapter","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":